      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 844069453324745015, guid: cf2c8b4c82570f54ca5def354616ee0a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: act1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2596584769100245686, guid: cf2c8b4c82570f54ca5def354616ee0a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: title
      value: "\u94DC\u5236\u6F5C\u6C34\u5934\u76D4Brass diving helmet"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2596584769100245686, guid: cf2c8b4c82570f54ca5def354616ee0a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: introduction
      value: "\u4F20\u7EDF\u6F5C\u6C34\u5934\u76D4\u5E38\u7531\u94DC\u4E0E\u9EC4\u94DC\u5236\u6210\uFF0C\u5E76\u914D\u6709\u73BB\u7483\u89C6\u7A97\u3002\u5934\u76D4\u4E0E\u80F8\u80A9\u6258\u67B6\u3001\u9632\u6C34\u6F5C\u6C34\u670D\u8FDE\u63A5\uFF0C\u6784\u6210\u6C34\u9762\u4F9B\u6C14\u6F5C\u6C34\u88C5\u5907\u7684\u4E00\u90E8\u5206\u3002\r\n\u6F5C\u6C34\u5458\u901A\u8FC7\u8FDE\u63A5\u6C34\u9762\u6C14\u6CF5\u7684\u8F6F\u7BA1\u83B7\u5F97\u7A7A\u6C14\uFF0C\u5E76\u900F\u8FC7\u89C6\u7A97\u89C2\u5BDF\u5468\u56F4\u73AF\u5883\u3002\r\n\u4ED4\u7EC6\u89C2\u5BDF\u5934\u76D4\u7684\u91D1\u5C5E\u5916\u58F3\u3001\u89C6\u7A97\u548C\u8FDE\u63A5\u90E8\u4F4D\uFF1A\u5B83\u4EEC\u5982\u4F55\u5E2E\u52A9\u6F5C\u6C34\u5458\u5728\u6C34\u4E0B\u5DE5\u4F5C\uFF1F\r\n\u672C\u8BF4\u660E\u4ECB\u7ECD\u4F20\u7EDF\u94DC\u5236\u6F5C\u6C34\u5934\u76D4\u7684\u4E00\u822C\u7ED3\u6784\uFF0C\u5177\u4F53\u578B\u53F7\u7684\u8BBE\u8BA1\u53EF\u80FD\u4E0D\u540C\u3002\r\n\r\nTraditional
        diving helmets are typically made of copper and brass, and are fitted with
        glass visors. The helmet is connected to a chest and shoulder harness and
        a waterproof diving suit, forming part of a surface-supplied diving system.\r\nDivers
        receive air through a hose connected to a surface air pump and observe their
        surroundings through the visor.\r\nTake a close look at the helmet\u2019s
        metal shell, viewing window and connecting parts: how do they help the diver
        to work underwater?\r\nThis guide outlines the general structure of a traditional
        copper diving helmet; the design of specific models may vary."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7327601240632177358, guid: cf2c8b4c82570f54ca5def354616ee0a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: instructions
      value: "\u8BD5\u6234\u6F5C\u6C34\u5934\u76D4 / Try the diving helmet\r\n\u6309\u4F4F\u63E1\u628A\u6293\u53D6
        \u2192 \u79FB\u5230\u5934\u90E8\u9644\u8FD1 \u2192 \u677E\u5F00\u4F69\u6234\r\nHold
        grip \u2192 bring to your head \u2192 release\r\n\u6309 B / Y \u53D6\u4E0B\u5E76\u653E\u56DE\u5C55\u53F0
        / Return to stand"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7327601240632177358, guid: cf2c8b4c82570f54ca5def354616ee0a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: successMessage
      value: "\u4F69\u6234\u6210\u529F\uFF01 / Helmet equipped!\r\n\u6309 B / Y \u53EF\u53D6\u4E0B\u5934\u76D4"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects:
    - targetCorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 71332047387206541, guid: cf2c8b4c82570f54ca5def354616ee0a, type: 3}
